{"unit_id":"ZSQBFan__dsh-chat-sessions#card-zh","repo":"ZSQBFan/dsh-chat-sessions","commit":"90bcee4119b21b4152a9a9cb065f243d50e29435","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-sessions 是一个适用于 DSH 网页客户端的独立会话插件，可让用户不先选择项目工作区就开始对话。它在 DSH 会话服务中创建独立会话目录，并在工作区选择器中加入独立对话入口，再通过标题链接和原生工作区接入侧栏。主要功能包括一键创建独立对话、为新会话提供工作目录、按标题整理会话文件入口，以及沿用原生侧栏的置顶、归档和恢复操作。适合希望快速开始临时问答或小型任务、又想让任务文件分开管理的 DSH 用户。默认无需 API 密钥；需要 DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 至 0.3.0 之前版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:35-41","index.js:152-159","client.js:24-38","links.js:4-20"]}
{"unit_id":"ZSQBFan__dsh-chat-sessions#card-en","repo":"ZSQBFan/dsh-chat-sessions","commit":"90bcee4119b21b4152a9a9cb065f243d50e29435","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-chat-sessions adds standalone chats to DSH's web client, with a working directory per new chat. Choose the standalone entry in the workspace picker, then manage chats through the native sidebar. It also organizes files by title and maintains session links and workspaces. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:35-41","index.js:152-159","client.js:24-38","links.js:4-20"]}
